        rdfs:comment "Planispiral forms are plausible; all high-spired / conical reference taxa are wrong because the spire never develops. Evidence: raup_shell_animation.gif (generated output, not in repo): mid-animation frame: six panels, all planispiral — raup_shell_animation.gif: rendered output of create_raup_animations.py at f3fe478, image/gif, 24248756 B, 3600×2400 px, 161 frames, sha256 aea20e93a9a79a94a4685ba67c78684cf879030e2a3c5ff552cfad44cd43bc51." ;
